// The world: maps, people, trainers, story flags, items, songs. data/world.c holds the data and is edited by hand
// (it began as an export of the JS game). The painter (tools/paint.c) draws the maps and people from it.
//
// Tile letters. Outdoors: T tree, . grass, f flowers, , tall grass, p path, ~ water, R/B/G red, blue, purple roof,
// H wall, W window, D door, S sign, L ledge (hop down only), n fence, k pier, X rock wall, q cave floor, E cave mouth,
// j marsh (wild creatures), z steel deck, K tree to CUT, Y rock to SMASH, O boulder to push. Indoors: w wall,
// v window, r poster, o floor, c counter, h shelf, m exit mat, u rug, P plant, y sofa. LIGHTHOUSE: b brick wall,
// g slate floor (wild creatures in dark caves), U stairs. North: s snow, A deep snow (wild creatures), F snowy fir. ICE CAVE: Q ice wall, I ice (you slide until something stops you), e frosted floor (wild creatures). SUNKEN SHRINE: brick b and slate g, flooded halls you SURF across.
